{"id":"steam-1379680","steam":1379680,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"PoliPlanet","summary":"Set on small procedurally generated planets, PoliPlanet is a unique first-person city building game.\r\n\r\nDiscover new planets, gather resources, craft, explore, and build.","about":"Travel from planet to planet and develop each one into a beautiful village, town, or city through the use of machines and crafting!\r\n\r\nPhysics-Based Interaction\r\n\r\n    Actions in PoliPlanet are completed by interacting with the physical world rather than through the use of menus and UI.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBuilding\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nProgression\r\n\r\n    As you develop your skills, you'll learn more about the resources at your disposal and gain the ability to craft bigger and better structures and machines.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/library_600x900.jpg?t=1669477789","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/header.jpg?t=1669477789","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/library_hero.jpg?t=1669477789","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/header.jpg?t=1669477789","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/ss_eebbde42977524b8d7b5dcc178117a4632a453d7.600x338.jpg?t=1669477789","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/ss_eebbde42977524b8d7b5dcc178117a4632a453d7.jpg?t=1669477789"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/ss_c69670fb647f6400c51e9869e3dfef14adb231d2.600x338.jpg?t=1669477789","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/ss_c69670fb647f6400c51e9869e3dfef14adb231d2.jpg?t=1669477789"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379680/ss_5b990cb45d8a